WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.368 --> 00:00:03.251
限定本轮 HTTP/2 路径 / Scope this run’s HTTP/2 paths

2
00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.160
开启 Recording / Start Recording

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.144
接收第一段但保持连接未结束 / Receive the first part without ending the response

4
00:00:09.144 --> 00:00:12.156
选择仍在接收的 stream / Select the stream while receiving

5
00:00:12.156 --> 00:00:15.119
核对声明的完整长度 / Inspect the declared complete length

6
00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:18.064
区分接收进度与正文可读性 / Distinguish received bytes from a readable body

7
00:00:18.064 --> 00:00:21.065
继续接收第二段 / Receive the second part

8
00:00:21.065 --> 00:00:24.355
结束响应并核对完整正文 / End the response and verify the complete body

9
00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:27.682
查看结束时的 trailer / Inspect the completion trailer

10
00:00:27.682 --> 00:00:30.685
展开 Protocol 分组 / Expand the Protocol group

11
00:00:30.685 --> 00:00:33.765
选择实际 HTTP/2 协议 / Select the actual HTTP/2 protocol

12
00:00:33.765 --> 00:00:36.818
观察客户端中断与新连接 / Observe client interruption and a new connection

13
00:00:36.818 --> 00:00:39.909
选择原来的 POST / Select the original POST

14
00:00:39.909 --> 00:00:42.909
查看仍声明 524288 的 Header / Inspect the Header still declaring 524288 bytes

15
00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:46.063
读取真正捕获到的部分正文 / Read the actually captured partial body

16
00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:49.784
选择独立的 recovered GET / Select the separate recovered GET

17
00:00:49.784 --> 00:00:52.955
读取新连接的正常响应 / Read the normal response on the new connection

18
00:00:52.955 --> 00:00:55.924
观察源站中断与新连接 / Observe origin interruption and a new connection

19
00:00:55.924 --> 00:00:59.070
选择原来的 POST / Select the original POST

20
00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.113
查看仍声明 524288 的 Header / Inspect the Header still declaring 524288 bytes

21
00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:05.315
读取真正捕获到的部分正文 / Read the actually captured partial body

22
00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:08.550
选择独立的 recovered GET / Select the separate recovered GET

23
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.709
读取新连接的正常响应 / Read the normal response on the new connection

24
00:01:11.709 --> 00:01:14.727
返回 Settings / Return to Settings

25
00:01:14.727 --> 00:01:17.716
打开 Certificates / Open Certificates

26
00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:20.964
关闭本轮 HTTPS 解密 / Disable this run’s HTTPS decryption

27
00:01:20.964 --> 00:01:24.273
移除本轮源站例外 / Remove this run’s origin exception
